+### keybindings — 快捷键与硬件手势绑定 ✅
+
+声明插件的默认快捷键与 C++ 硬件手势（用户可在偏好设置中自定义覆盖）：
+
+```json
+{
+  "contributes": {
+    "keybindings": [
+      {
+        "command": "com.berrytrace.plugin.voice-agents:start-listening",
+        "title": "Voice Agent 对话唤醒",
+        "key": "Option+Space",
+        "mac": "Option+Space",
+        "win": "Alt+Space",
+        "gesture": "combo:fn+space",
+        "when": "global"
+      }
+    ]
+  }
+}
+```
+
 ---
 
 ## `contributes` — 计划中的声明项